  "instructions": [
    "Cut the sole fillets into small pieces and place in a large bowl.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the yogurt, lime juice, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the raspberries, red onion, and chopped cilantro to the bowl with the sole.",
    "Pour the yogurt mixture over the sole mixture and stir gently to combine.",
    "Cover the bowl with plastic wrap and refrigerate for at least 30 minutes to allow the flavors to meld.",
    "Just before serving, prepare the beurre monte by whisking together the butter and heavy cream until stiff peaks form.",
    "Fold the beurre monte into the ceviche mixture and serve immediately.",
    "Garnish with additional raspberries and cilantro if desired."
